#: admin/admin.php:217
msgid "Grid & List"
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:218
msgid "Static logo layouts in a responsive grid or simple list."
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:220
msgid "A no-JavaScript CSS grid for when motion is not wanted. Per-device columns and gap, captions and descriptions, hover overlays with slide and scale animations, and full typography control."
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:225
msgid "Stagger"
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:226
msgid "Offset sliding rows with a smooth staggered motion effect."
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:228
msgid "Rotates logos in and out of a grid one cell at a time. Eight animation presets including rotate, fill in, skew and blur, with adjustable stagger delay and group pause."
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:233
msgid "Ticker"
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:234
msgid "Infinite marquee scrolling that never stops or resets."
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:236
msgid "A continuously scrolling logo strip with pixel-per-second speed control and pause on hover. Logos are cloned automatically so the loop never visibly restarts."
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:241
msgid "Marquee"
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:242
msgid "CSS-only scrolling row or column for any block content."
msgstr ""

#: admin/admin.php:244
msgid "Accepts any inner blocks, not just logos. Horizontal or vertical orientation, four directions, pause on hover, and per-item width, border and padding. Runs on pure CSS with no JavaScript."
msgstr ""

